# The yellow->amber rename (banshee-v54.1): alert episodes are stored as JSON and
# the store drops rows that fail to parse, so without the alias every episode
# recorded under the old band word silently vanishes from the Alerts tab.
file: rust/banshee-core/src/pressure/band.rs
test: an_episode_stored_with_the_old_band_word_is_still_read
